OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FManizha Bakhtari was posted to
OL,7,     FAustria as Afghan ambassador. When
OL,8,     Fthe Taliban seized power she
OL,9,     Frefused to budge and since 2021,
OL,10,     Fremains the country's only female
OL,11,     Fambassador.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1999, Canada's map was redrawn
OL,14,     Fto create Nunavut, a territory
OL,15,     Freflecting Inuit land rights. It
OL,16,     Ffollowed more than 20 years of
OL,17,     Fcampaigning.
